  },
  {
   "section": "5",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Dynamic Mast Control",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Dynamic-Mast-Control.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "The driver assistance system Dynamic Mast Control for reach trucks from Linde Material Handling ensures increased safety and efficiency by reducing mast oscillation."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Dynamic-Mast-Control.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Optimal Mast, Optimal Handling",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Reach-mast-R14-R25/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "With the new HD reach mast for R14 – R25 reach trucks, Linde brings you improved visibility, greater lifting height, enhanced stability, and higher residual load capacities."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Reach-mast-R14-R25/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Linde VertiLight and Linde LED Stripes",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Linde-VertiLight-and-Linde-LED-Stripes.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Having the right amount of light at all times is essential to safety and efficiency when working with industrial trucks. With the Linde VertiLight and Linde LED Stripes, Linde Material Handling offers two innovative lighting concepts."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Linde-VertiLight-and-Linde-LED-Stripes.html"
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 3,
   "editableTexts": 6,
