  {
   "section": "6",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Active Stability Control",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Active-Stability-Control.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Very narrow aisle trucks are used for working at great height. The aisles are narrow and the distances to the rack are calculated very precisely. Because of that, even the slightest unevenness in the warehouse floor can become a problem. Linde Material Handling’s Active Stability Control assistance system for the K truck provides an innovative solution."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Active-Stability-Control.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Linde Warehouse Navigation",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Linde-Warehouse-Navigation.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Narrow pathways and high lifting heights—narrow aisle storage is cost-effective for companies, but at the same time places high demands on the trucks working there and their operators. Linde Warehouse Navigation supports the driver and greatly increases productivity."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Linde-Warehouse-Navigation.html"
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 2,
   "editableTexts": 4,
