  {
   "section": "8",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "The Innovative Linde Steer Control Concept",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Linde-Steer-Control/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Linde Steer Control is a revolutionary concept for forklift steering. A mini-wheel or joystick replaces the conventional steering wheel."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Linde-Steer-Control/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Linde Multifunction Lever",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Multifunction-lever/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "The Linde Multifunction Lever is a new human machine interface that integrates all operating functions and ensures the best possible ergonomics and optimum ease of use."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Multifunction-lever/index.html"
    }
   ],
