  {
   "section": "10",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Your Intelligent Charge Management",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/connect-charger/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "The Linde Material Handling connect:charger provides a cost-effective and intelligent solution for managing the charging of electric industrial trucks."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/connect-charger/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "The energy system for the logistics of today and tomorrow",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Lithium-Ionen.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "The material handling equipment industry has long been a pioneer in electromobility. The challenge: to achieve the same high vehicle availability as with combustion engine-powered vehicles. This is where Linde's Li-ION technology demonstrates its strengths."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Lithium-Ionen.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Let’s Go Hydrogen",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Fuel-Cells.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Hydrogen is an important building block in the energy mix of the future. Linde Material Handling offers state-of-the-art fuel cell technology for a wide range of industrial trucks."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Fuel-Cells.html"
    }
   ],
