  {
   "section": "14",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Linde Safety Guard",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Linde-Safety-Guard.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Wherever industrial trucks are in use, there exists a complex interplay between man and machine. Linde Safety Guard is an innovative assistance system which increases safety for both truck operators and pedestrians in the vicinity of the truck."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Linde-Safety-Guard.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Linde Door Control",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Linde-Door-Control/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "With Linde Door Control, collisions between forklift trucks and high-speed doors are a thing of the past. The door control system provides protection to trucks passing through doors and saves costs."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Linde-Door-Control/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Pedestrian Warning Band for Maximum Safety",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Pedestrian-Warning-Band/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "The smart technology in the band warns pedestrians of potential dangers early using light signals, vibrations, and acoustic warnings, thereby maximizing safety."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Pedestrian-Warning-Band/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "Linde Safety Pilot",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Linde-Safety-Pilot.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "Using the Safety Pilot from Linde Material Handling when driving counterbalance forklift trucks helps to prevent them from tipping over in most cases."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Linde-Safety-Pilot.html"
    }
   ],
