     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Load-Management.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Linde Load Management Advanced makes moving goods with pallet stackers easier and safer. It gives the operator clear visual and acoustic warning signals on a large color display. It even disables the lifting function automatically if the actual load weight exceeds the maximum load capacity."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Load-Management.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "Navigating Narrow Aisles Risk-Free",
