    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "For all-round protection in any situation: the personal protection system from Linde MH sets new safety standards in narrow aisles."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Learn more",
